{"sha": "6b6514467d4a3d67a72b7e82108507a7ed50a06b061cc69d8f0bd2f4174d5b2c", "body": ["\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:irreversible-changes:2}", "什么是化学变化？请举出两个厨房里的例子。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:irreversible-changes:3}", "盐溶解在水中。怎样才能把盐重新取回？", "溶解是可逆变化吗？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:irreversible-changes:4}", "牛奶变酸时，你注意到化学变化的哪种迹象？", "请说出两个。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:irreversible-changes:5}", "看一看这幅分为两栏的图，哪些变化带有双箭头？", "双箭头表示什么意思？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:irreversible-changes:6}", "为什么要给自行车链条上油？", "油能减慢哪一种化学变化？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:irreversible-changes:7}", "把醋倒在小苏打上时会冒出气泡，这是哪一种迹象？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:irreversible-changes:8}", "请各举一个有益的化学变化和一个有害的化学变化。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:irreversible-changes:9}", "为什么要把牛奶放在冰箱里？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:irreversible-changes:10}", "水沸腾时会冒泡。沸腾是否为化学变化？请说明", "为什么仅凭一种迹象是不够的。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g5:irreversible-changes:11}", "汤姆说：“蜡烛燃烧时，蜡就像冰一样融化掉了。”", "用两个迹象解释为什么燃烧蜡烛是化学变化，", "而不只是熔化。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}